## Context
Audit finding C6 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`).
- `scripts/on-start.sh:6-7` says `.env` secrets reach bash via `BASH_ENV`;
  since 0945 `bash-env.sh` loads no credential.
- `rules/README.md` says `tickets/AGENTS.md` reaches a session via
  `@tickets/AGENTS.md` in the project's `CLAUDE.md`; projects now load
  `AGENTS.md` natively and only point to `tickets/AGENTS.md`.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] `on-start.sh` comment matches `bash-env.sh` behaviour
- [ ] `rules/README.md` states the harness-only scope of the `@` import
- [ ] `make check` passes
